    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The land of Novariel is a vast and peaceful one. But one day slimes in different colors and clothing appeared and made the once peaceful world a dangerous one.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your hero and fight against the slimes! Free the cities, help the lost citizens and explore a vast world ready for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a singleplayer RPG. It features a basic character creation, round based combat and an endless world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">World generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is procedurally generated and offers currently the following tile-types with the mentioned content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>City: </strong> Houses, Trees, Rocks, Ores and NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Forest: </strong> Trees, Rocks, Ores, NPCs, Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Plane: </strong>  Trees, Rocks, Ores, NPCs, Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Mountain: </strong>  Trees, Rocks, Ores, NPCs, Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>River: </strong>  Trees, Rocks, Ores, NPCs, Enemies, River</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Lake: </strong>  Trees, Rocks, Ores, NPCs, Enemies, Lake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Desert: </strong>  Trees, Rocks, Ores, NPCs, Enemies, Lake </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Races</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between the following races:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Human: </strong> The basic race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Dwarf: </strong> Small but strong, always ready to fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Elf: </strong> Fragile but agile. Never angry an elf with a bow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Giant: </strong> The biggest race in Novariel. Stupid but dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Goblin: </strong> The rarest race. You want to challenge yourself? Play a Goblin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nightelf: </strong> Elfs but with dark mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between the following classes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Warrior: </strong> You want a sword? Take it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Mage: </strong> -Weird magic noises-</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Thief: </strong> Why are my pockets always filled with gold?</p></li></ul>",
